{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/28452d2ea0d7a84ed74ab8d8cd416c09.poster.avif?t=1729099556\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/28452d2ea0d7a84ed74ab8d8cd416c09.webm?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/28452d2ea0d7a84ed74ab8d8cd416c09.mp4?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Maquette is a first-person recursive puzzle game that takes you into a world where every building, plant, and object are simultaneously tiny and staggeringly huge.  Maquette makes it possible by twisting the world into itself recursively in an MC Escher-esque fashion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/59b59b45af1b537be4eb4c60a5dba92a.poster.avif?t=1729099556\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/59b59b45af1b537be4eb4c60a5dba92a.webm?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/59b59b45af1b537be4eb4c60a5dba92a.mp4?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>Head to the center of the world and you'll feel like a giant, towering over buildings and walls. But venture further out, and start to feel small as things get larger and larger - to the point where cracks in the ground become chasms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/2ce16ce437c2eddc4f4819ccc04a7153.poster.avif?t=1729099556\" width=600 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/2ce16ce437c2eddc4f4819ccc04a7153.webm?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762840/extras/2ce16ce437c2eddc4f4819ccc04a7153.mp4?t=1729099556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>In Maquette you will explore the scales of everyday problems in a modern-day love story.  Where sometimes the smallest of issues can become insurmountable obstacles.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"259c8f525afb51280615ad103d6e169658cbcaa4.jpg","localized_name":"The Gardens","name":"The Gardens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/259c8f525afb51280615ad103d6e169658cbcaa4.jpg"},{"icon":"2c5dcc7bf558ac482aa6accb3b6c9497f38eff52.jpg","localized_name":"The Maquette","name":"The Maquette","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/2c5dcc7bf558ac482aa6accb3b6c9497f38eff52.jpg"},{"icon":"d716149e7350de92cfbb63e9d804c1082a312c1c.jpg","localized_name":"The Gateways","name":"The Gateways","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/d716149e7350de92cfbb63e9d804c1082a312c1c.jpg"},{"icon":"f33df2e7d167b5abf88e62302ee9790ff955b641.jpg","localized_name":"The Wedge","name":"The Wedge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/f33df2e7d167b5abf88e62302ee9790ff955b641.jpg"},{"icon":"5dd88b7802bc845d9f4813eab071fe6c0c7be6fe.jpg","localized_name":"The Escape","name":"The Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/5dd88b7802bc845d9f4813eab071fe6c0c7be6fe.jpg"},{"icon":"56e02b9022ecbbc6f960da89cd98d46e44859aff.jpg","localized_name":"The Spiral","name":"The Spiral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/762840/56e02b9022ecbb